From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 21:17:53 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] aconfig: enable the ime switcher button in navbar setting

the keyboard settings switch that hides the ime language switcher button
is already in settings and inputmethodmanagerservice, gated on
ime_switcher_button_in_navbar_setting. enable the flag in cp2a so the
toggle is offered.
---
 ..._switcher_button_in_navbar_setting_flag_values.textproto | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 aconfig/cp2a/android.view.inputmethod/ime_switcher_button_in_navbar_setting_flag_values.textproto

diff --git a/aconfig/cp2a/android.view.inputmethod/ime_switcher_button_in_navbar_setting_flag_values.textproto b/aconfig/cp2a/android.view.inputmethod/ime_switcher_button_in_navbar_setting_flag_values.textproto
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..266e8bd
--- /dev/null
+++ b/aconfig/cp2a/android.view.inputmethod/ime_switcher_button_in_navbar_setting_flag_values.textproto
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+flag_value {
+  package: "android.view.inputmethod"
+  name: "ime_switcher_button_in_navbar_setting"
+  state: ENABLED
+  permission: READ_ONLY
+}
-- 
2.56.0

